      "problem": "Complete the following facts about the function $y=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.$\n\nThe domain of the function is $x\\in ($\n{{field-1}}\n$,$\n{{field-2}}\n$).$\n\nThe range of the function is $[$\n{{field-3}}\n$,$\n{{field-4}}\n$].$\n\nThe period of the function is\n{{field-5}}.",
